        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isumaacho ya Erihu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono abhantö bhatatö bhano: Sobhari, Bhiritati na Sobhari, bhakahatëra kuhunchukiria Ayubhu kugira ëno airööchë iga nömöröngë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nëho Erihu, ömoona o Bharakeri, kurua gukiaro ke Bhusi, wë ëka ya Ramu, akarëërra. Akarërëërra Ayubhu kugira nkanyoora Ayubhu aikorrë ömöröngë gökëra ninyoora në Ënooköë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guiki, naarërëëyë abhasaani bhatatö bha Ayubhu, kugira tëbhaarë na iyakuhunchukiria Ayubhu hai, na igo koorokia iga Ënooköë nömösaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erihu wanyoorrë aikaayë nkiri nkaaga abhagaaka bhaara bhaarë gusumaacha na Ayubhu kugira we nö ömoona möke aarëngë gökëra bho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono hano aarööchë abhantö bhatatö bhaara bhakërröë kuhunchukiria Ayubhu, öbhörrö mboomötachërë.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
